：\n\n转变成吉卜力风格\n转变成3D卡通风格\n转变成Chibi风格\n\n4、获取不同角度：\n\n获得正视视角\n朝向左侧\n朝向右侧\n朝向后侧\n\n5、IP角色灵活用：\n这只熊拿着五彩画板和画笔，站在画板前画画\n这只熊戴着草帽，手里拿着花洒和小铲子，正在浇水或种植植物\n这只熊穿着燕尾服，戴着魔术帽，手里拿着魔术棒，做出表演魔术的动作，背景是华丽的舞台，\n\n6、增加元素：\n在左侧添加一个小木牌，上面写着“欢迎来到企鹅海滩”。\n\n7、消除元素：\n把左侧青蛙移除掉\n\n8、修改文字：\n把“新品上市”改成“夏日促销”\n\n9、指定修改框框内容：\nReplace the word inside red bounding box with \"ABC\",Only modify the text inside the box,keeping everything outside unchanged."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [381.90386962890625, 537.5184326171875], "pos": [-1419.833251953125, 2278.78662109375], "id": 310, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 540, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [303.8403015136719, 316.14495849609375], "pos": [274.9832763671875, 2690.60595703125], "id": 349, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_raacb_00005_crrfj_1755961450.png&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.03854963027520064&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJmMWY5NjBhNzhlYmEyZWQ0MzhkNDVmNzhhMTljOWJkOSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NTY1NjU4OTY1ODksInRzIjoxNzU1OTYxMDk2NTg5LCJzaWduIjoiYjk3MjdhY2M5ZDhjN2UwYzc3MDQ2YTY2NTA0MzRlZGQifQ==&Rh-Identify=f1f960a78eba2ed438d45f78a19c9bd9"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_raacb_00006_qmlhx_1755961452.png&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.9802510223808603&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJmMWY5NjBhNzhlYmEyZWQ0MzhkNDVmNzhhMTljOWJkOSIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NTY1NjU4OTY1ODksInRzIjoxNzU1OTYxMDk2NTg5LCJzaWduIjoiYjk3MjdhY2M5ZDhjN2UwYzc3MDQ2YTY2NTA0MzRlZGQifQ==&Rh-Identify=f1f960a78eba2ed438d45f78a19c9bd9"}]], "inputs": [{"name": "image_a", "link": 524, "label": 